MAMUT-routing AILS-II patch for a shared random seed and CVRPLIB solution output.

The Mamut2026 BKS campaign used vinymax10/AILS-CVRP at e631331c76f001e652af9895e27f0fd8da8698c0. An archived version is available in the authors' INFORMS Journal on Computing snapshot at INFORMSJoC/2023.0106 revision 4ff361153681635149e30305057251e9035ec6b7. Apply this patch at the root of either checkout.

Campaign patch: https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-Mamut2026/blob/e57c1af3d8f21587fac38678fbdf8cff02b8c1e9/campaigns/2026-09-bks-campaign-3/ails2.patch
Campaign patch SHA-256: 34b155e2efc58aade793c48de46a3fd7f763bbb2f884f043d476ad8106075031
The first five diffs are unchanged. The sixth installs the original SharedRandom.java text as a new file.

